window.products.push({"id":161298,"name":"COTLIN Undercounter Ice Maker 22LBS/24H, 15 Inch Built-in Ice Maker Machine with Water Line for Residential Boat RV, Quiet Operation No Drain Required","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qw3pTl-OL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Built-in Undercounter Ice Maker】COTLIN ice machine makes up to 22lbs of crescent ice a day! With 22lbs large ice storage bin, it holds plenty of ice for large families, parties, cookouts, or any of your entertaining needs. Bring the transparent and taste-free ice served in bars and restaurants right into the comforts of your own home, outdoor kitchen, RV and even boat or yacht. 【Compact Undercounter Size】Crescent ice maker is 14.8” x 21.3” x 27.8” in size which makes it easier to fit under standard kitchen bar counter, ensure convenient access to ice. Cutout dimension is 15.38’’*23.35’’*28.25’’, make sure leaving enough space to install and keep it ventilation. Compact and freestanding design make it easy to transport and you can keep it anywhere you want like custom man cave or den, just connect it to the water line. 【Unique Ice Shape & Keep Ice Frozen】Our residential ice machine produce crystal-clear, odorless crescent shaped ice that keep your beverage truer to the ﬂavors you love. Crescent ice feature slow-melting, uniquely-shaped that’s perfect for premium liquor and mixed drinks. Plus, equipped with powerful freezer inside, always keeping ice frozen from 21.2-32℉avoid melting. 【Durable Material & Reversible Door】Crafted with a sturdy heavy duty stainless steel and black matte, this compact ice maker offer the consumer a long-term reliability and also a perfect combination of other home appliance. The door and the hinge is reversible, you can choose to install left or right side according to your need. It’s easy to clean and maintain, very quiet during daily operation, make sure manual defrost regularly after use. 【Easy to Use & 100% Satisfaction】As a free-standing commercial ice machine you simply connect the water supply connector and the power cord to create a hands-free system that produces ice continuously to ensure you’re always party ready. Include ice scoop, water line, and removable ice bin. COTLIN is committed to providing customers with after sales service and we guarantee 30 days new replacement on quality problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qw3pTl-OL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COTLIN","source_asin":"B0BNBH3CSK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-161298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBH3CSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBH3CSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
