window.products.push({"id":161450,"name":"INKBIRD IBS-M2 WiFi Gateway with Temperature Humidity Monitor Sensor, Smart App Control, Works with INKBIRD Wireless/Bluetooth Sensors, Indoor Thermo-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IFaU8rwbL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Wi-Fi Gateway】: This Wi-Fi gateway integrates with temperature and humidity sensors and enables us to monitor the real-time temperature and humidity at the same time. With its Wi-Fi capability, we can also control and monitor the device from a smartphone via a 2.4GHz Wi-Fi network. 【Multiple Connections, Multiple Monitoring】: With the multi-connectivity function, it can simultaneously connect up to nine wireless/Bluetooth thermometers and hygrometers of INKBIRD. Through the IBS-M2, we can monitor each of them from the smartphone, such as checking current temperature and humidity, viewing max/min/average, and seeing 1-year history. 【Large LCD Displays Everything】: Thanks to its large LCD screen, we can view all current temperature and humidity values of the IBS-M2 and its sub-devices at a glance. If we choose the CH0 display mode, the temperature and humidity detected by nine sub-devices will automatically appear on the screen for 3 seconds in sequence. 【Real-time Alert with Notification】: We can set high and low temperature/humidity alarming values for the IBS-M2 and its sub-devices on the app. When the detected temperature/humidity reaches the preset value, the associated device will beep to remind us and send a notification through our smartphone. We can turn off the alarm remotely and also check all alarm records on the app. 【Ensure A Comfortable Living Place】: With its easy setup and user-friendly functions, this product helps us easily monitor the temperature and humidity of multiple rooms simultaneously to ensure the living comfort of our family. It’s also suitable for any place needed strict control of temperature and humidity, such as wine cellars, grow tents, cheese rooms, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IFaU8rwbL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inkbird","source_asin":"B0BLCBDX6F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-161450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCBDX6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCBDX6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
