window.products.push({"id":161700,"name":"Frigidaire 30\" White Gas Cooktop with 4 Sealed Burners FFGC3010QW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W58jFsDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At 30 inches wide, Frigidaire's 4-burner gas cooktop can handle any meal big or small. Four sealed burners bring you cooking power up to 15,000 BTU max. The front-right burner goes to 15,000 BTU for high-powered cooking such as boiling pasta or frying crispy treats. The rear right burner has a maximum BTU of 5,000 which makes it perfect for low-level cooking such as simmering food, keeping foods warm. Transitioning between these burners is smooth over continuous, cast-iron cooking grates. Beneath the grates is a deep well making the spill-proof surface easy to clean after cooking. The control knobs are in front of the burners to avoid reaching over active flames. The cooktop is ADA compliant, and it is approved to be installed over an under-counter, electric oven. Comes with a liquid propane conversion kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W58jFsDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frigidaire","source_asin":"B00XL2HG38","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-161700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XL2HG38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XL2HG38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
