window.products.push({"id":161887,"name":"BANGSON Small Fridge with Freezer, 4.0 Cu.Ft, Samll Refrigerator with Freezer, 5 Settings Temperature Adjustable, 2 Doors, Compact Fridge for Apartmen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mMCIgf8vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Space-saving and enough capacity fridge:BANGSON fridge of 4.0 Cu.Ft, 17.9\" W x18.3\" D x 45\"H,only occupying an area of 2.28 sq.ft. With a freezer capacity of 0.96 Cu.Ft and a refrigerated section capacity of 3.04 Cu.Ft, this small refrigerator is designed to optimize space while providing ample room for storing your favorite food and beverages.It is ideal for dorms,apartments,bedroom,office,and kitchen. 5 temperature settings: The BANGSON fridge has five temperature settings with excellent cooling performance. The freezer ranges from -4 to 10.4°F and the refrigerator,from 28.4 to 50°F.The temperature settings range from 1 (highest) to 5 (lowest), with 3 being the optimal temperature. You can store various foods including meat, eggs, milk, beer,coffee,vegetables, fruit, and ice cream. Enjoy optimal food preservation with our adjustable temperature fridge. Efficient internal compartments:the compact fridge has a double-door design with a separate freezer and refrigerator. The refrigerated section includes three removable glass shelves,you can freely adjust the height of the compartment in this area to meet your storage needs. The crisper drawer provides a separate storage area for fruits and vegetables, which is more hygienic and clean. The side door racks offer beverage storage, and the bottom of the area fits three 67.6 oz servings of beverage. Energy-efficient and quiet: This refrigerator is designed to save energy and operates at an average of 38 dB during normal use, which won't disturb your daily life.Please note that due to transport, the refrigerator may experience some bumps, so it's recommended to place it upright for 6-12 hours before plugging it in to ensure its quiet operation and longer lifespan. Enhanced details: BANGSON's compact fridge comes with reversible doors to fit your preference. The automatic night light in the refrigeration compartment makes it easy to locate items in the dark. The bottom leveling legs allow it for stable placement on uneven surfaces. The removable door seal makes cleaning a breeze. It also includes an ice tray and a defrost tool. For any inquiries, please don't hesitate to contact us as we are committed to providing excellent customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mMCIgf8vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANGSON","source_asin":"B0C4DL746D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-161887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4DL746D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4DL746D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
